@startuml
title Digidoclocker State Machine

[*] --> Citizen

state Citizen
Citizen : do / register, login

state LoggedInCitizen
LoggedInCitizen : do / upload documents, view profile, apply for certificate, continue uploading, reapply

state LoggedInRegistrar
LoggedInRegistrar : do / request certificate, continue requesting

state NoSession
NoSession : do / end session

Citizen --> LoggedInCitizen : Register, Login
LoggedInCitizen --> NoSession : EndSession
LoggedInCitizen --> LoggedInCitizen : UploadDocuments, ViewProfile, ApplyForCertificate, ContinueUploading, Reapply
Registrar --> LoggedInRegistrar : Register, Login, RequestCertificate
LoggedInRegistrar --> NoSession : EndSession
LoggedInRegistrar --> LoggedInRegistrar : RequestCertificate

NoSession --> [*]
@enduml
